hadiths[31]{hadithnumber,text}:
"813","Bara bin Aazib (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab apne bistar par aatey to daayein pehlu par sotey, phir farmatey: Ae Allah! Main ne apni jaan Tere supurd ki, aur apna chehra Teri taraf mutawajjah kya, aur apna muamla Tere hawale kya, aur apni peeth Teri taraf jhukai, Teri taraf raghbat aur khauf ke sath, Tujh se bachney ke liye Tere siwa koi panah aur nijaat nahi. Main Teri kitab par imaan laya jo Tune naazil ki aur Tere Nabi par jo Tune bheja. Ise Bukhari ne isi lafz ke sath apni Sahih ki Kitabul Adab mein riwayat kya hai."
"814","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Jab tum apne bistar par aao to namaz ke wuzu ki tarah wuzu karo, phir daayein pehlu par late jao aur kaho... aur isi tarah ki dua zikr ki aur us mein farmaya: Aur inhein apna aakhri kalaam banao. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"815","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) raat mein gyarah rakaatein padhtey they, phir jab fajr tuloo hoti to do halki rakaatein padhtey, phir daayein pehlu par late jatey yahan tak ke moazzin aakar Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko ittila deta. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"816","Huzaifa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab raat mein apne bistar par aatey to apna haath apne rukhsaar ke neechey rakhtey, phir farmatey: Ae Allah! Tere naam ke sath main marta hun aur jeeta hun. Aur jab bedaar hotey to farmatey: Tamam tareefein Allah ke liye hain jis ne hamein maut ke baad zinda kya aur usi ki taraf uthna hai. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"817","Ya'eesh bin Takhfa Ghaffari (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Merey walid ne kaha: Aik martaba main masjid mein pait ke bal leta hua tha ke aik shakhs ne mujhey apne paaon se hilaya phir farmaya: Ye aisa letna hai jisey Allah napasand farmata hai. Unhon-ne kaha: Phir main ne dekha to wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) they. Ise Abu Dawud ne sahih sanad se riwayat kya hai."
"818","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs kisi majlis mein baithey aur us mein Allah Taala ka zikr na karey to us par Allah Taala ki taraf se hasrat aur nuqsaan hoga, aur jo shakhs kisi bistar par latey aur us mein Allah Taala ka zikr na karey to us par Allah ki taraf se hasrat aur nuqsaan hoga. Ise Abu Dawud ne hasan sanad se riwayat kya hai. Tirah taey masnna fauq se kasra ke sath hai aur wo kami hai, aur kaha gaya ke wo zimmedari (ka bojh) hai."
"819","Abdullah bin Zaid (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko masjid mein chit let-tey huey dekha, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik paaon doosrey par rakha hua tha. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"820","Jabir bin Samura (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab fajr padhtey to apni majlis mein chaukdi maar kar baithey rehtey yahan tak ke suraj khoob tuloo ho jata. Sahih hadis hai, ise Abu Dawud waghera ne sahih asaneed se riwayat kya hai."
"821","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko Kaaba ke sehan mein dekha ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apne donon haathon se ihtiba kiye huey they is tarah, aur unhon-ne apne donon haathon se ihtiba ki kaifiyat bayan ki, aur wo ukdu baithey they. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"822","Qaila bint Makhrama (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekha jabke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ukdu baithey they, phir jab main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko majlis mein aajizi se baithey dekha to main khauf se kaanp gai. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai."
"823","Shareed bin Suwaid (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) merey paas se guzrey jabke main is tarah baitha hua tha, aur main ne apna baayan haath apni peeth ke peechey rakha hua tha aur apne haath ki kohni par tek lagaey tha, to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya tum un logon ki tarah baithey ho jin par ghazab kya gaya?! Ise Abu Dawud ne sahih sanad se riwayat kya hai."
"824","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi shakhs apne bhai ko uski majlis se uthakar khud us mein na baithey, lekin kushadgi aur wusat karo. Aur Ibn Umar jab unke liye koi aadmi apni majlis se uth-ta to wo us mein na baithetey. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"825","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi apni majlis se uthey phir uski taraf wapas aey to wo uska zyada haqdaar hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"826","Jabir bin Samura (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aatey to ham mein se har aik wahin baithta jahan majlis khatm hoti. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"827","Abu Abdullah Salman Farsi (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs Juma ke din ghusl karta hai aur jitna ho sakey pakeeza hota hai, aur apne tail mein se tail lagata hai ya apne ghar ki khushbu mein se lagata hai, phir nikalta hai aur do aadmiyon ke darmiyaan tafreeq nahi karta, phir jitni namaz uske liye likhi gai hai padhta hai, phir jab imam khutba dey to khamosh rehta hai, to uske liye is Juma aur doosrey Juma ke darmiyaan (gunah) bakhsh diye jatey hain. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"828","Amr bin Shuaib se apne walid se apne dada (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kisi shakhs ke liye halal nahi ke wo do aadmiyon ke darmiyaan unki ijazat ke baghair tafreeq karey. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai. Aur Abu Dawud ki aik riwayat mein hai: Do aadmiyon ke darmiyaan unki ijazat ke baghair na baithey."
"829","Huzaifa bin Al-Yamaan (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us shakhs par laanat ki jo halqey ke darmiyaan baithey. Ise Abu Dawud ne sahih sanad se riwayat kya hai. Aur Tirmizi ne Abu Mijlaz se riwayat kya hai ke aik aadmi halqey ke darmiyaan baitha to Huzaifa ne kaha: Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zabaan se halqey ke darmiyaan baithney waley par laanat ki gai hai. Tirmizi ne kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"830","Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Behtreen majlisein kushada tareen hain. Ise Abu Dawud ne Bukhari ki shart par sahih sanad se riwayat kya hai."
"831","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs kisi majlis mein baithey phir us mein uski laghv guftagu bahut ho jaey phir apni us majlis se uthney se pehley kahey: Ae Allah! Tu paak hai apni hamd ke sath, main gawahi deta hun ke Tere siwa koi mabood nahi, main Tujh se maghfirat maangta hun aur Teri taraf tauba karta hun, to uske liye wo bakhsh diya jata hai jo uski us majlis mein tha. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"832","Abu Barza (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab majlis se uthney ka irada farmatey to aakhir mein farmatey: Tu paak hai ae Allah aur Teri hamd ke sath, main gawahi deta hun ke Tere siwa koi mabood nahi, main Tujh se maghfirat maangta hun aur Teri taraf tauba karta hun. To aik aadmi ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak Aap aisi baat kehtey hain jo Aap pehley nahi kehtey they? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ye uska kaffara hai jo majlis mein hota hai. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kya hai. Aur ise Haakim Abu Abdullah ne Mustadrak mein Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ki riwayat se naql kya hai aur kaha: Sanad se sahih hai."
"833","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Kam hi hota tha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) kisi majlis se in duaon ke baghair uth-tey: Ae Allah! Hamarey liye apne khauf mein se itna hissa muqarrar farma jo hamarey aur Teri nafarmaniyon ke darmiyaan haail ho, aur apni itaat mein se itna jo hamein Teri Jannat tak pahunchaye, aur yaqeen mein se itna jo ham par duniya ki museebatein halki kar dey, ae Allah! Hamein hamarey kaanon aur hamari aankhon aur hamari quwwat se jab tak hamein zinda rakhey faeda pahunchatey reh, aur usey hamara waris bana, aur hamara badla us par rakh jis ne ham par zulm kya, aur uske muqabley mein hamari madad farma jo ham se dushmani rakhta hai, aur hamari museebat hamarey deen mein na bana, aur duniya ko hamara sab se bara ghum na bana aur na hamarey ilm ka muntaha, aur ham par usey musallat na kar jo ham par rehem nahi karta. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"834","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo qaum kisi majlis se uth-ti hai aur us mein Allah Taala ka zikr nahi karti to wo aise uth-ti hain jaisey gadhey ki murdaar laash par se uth-tey hain aur wo unke liye hasrat hogi. Ise Abu Dawud ne sahih sanad se riwayat kya hai."
"835","Unhin se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo qaum kisi majlis mein baithey aur us mein Allah Taala ka zikr na karein aur na us mein apne Nabi par durood bhejein to wo un par hasrat aur nuqsaan hogi, phir agar Allah chahey to unhey azaab dey aur agar chahey to unhey bakhsh dey. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"836","Unhin se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs kisi majlis mein baithey aur us mein Allah Taala ka zikr na karey to us par Allah ki taraf se hasrat aur nuqsaan hogi, aur jo shakhs kisi bistar par latey aur us mein Allah ka zikr na karey to us par Allah ki taraf se hasrat aur nuqsaan hogi. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kya hai. Aur ye guzar chuka hai qareeb hi, aur ham ne is mein tirah ki tashreeh kar di hai."
"837","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Nabuwwat mein se bashaartein ke siwa kuchh baqi nahi raha. Unhon-ne kaha: Bashaartein kya hain? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Achchha khuwab. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"838","Unhin se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab zamana qareeb ho jaeyga to momin ka khuwab shayed hi jhoota ho, aur momin ka khuwab nabuwwat ke chhiyalis hisson mein se aik hissa hai. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Tum mein se sab se sachey khuwab waley wo hain jo baat mein sab se sachey hain."
"839","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis ne mujhey khuwab mein dekha to wo anqareeb mujhey bedaari mein dekhega, ya goya us ne mujhey bedaari mein dekha, shaitaan meri soorat ikhtiyaar nahi kar sakta. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"840","Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Jab tum mein se koi aisa khuwab dekhey jisey wo pasand karta hai to wo sirf Allah Taala ki taraf se hai, isliye us par Allah ki hamd karey aur usey bayan karey, aur aik riwayat mein hai: To usey sirf us se bayan karey jis se wo mohabbat karta hai, aur jab uske siwa kuchh dekhey jo wo napasand karta hai to wo sirf shaitaan ki taraf se hai, isliye uske shar se panah maangey aur usey kisi se zikr na karey, kyonke wo usey nuqsaan nahi pahunchayega. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"841","Abu Qatada (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Achchha khuwab, aur aik riwayat mein hai: Pasandeeda khuwab Allah ki taraf se hai, aur bura khuwab shaitaan ki taraf se hai, to jo shakhs koi aisi chiz dekhey jo wo napasand karta hai to apne baayein taraf teen martaba thookey aur shaitaan se panah maangey kyonke wo usey nuqsaan nahi pahunchayega. (Muttafaqun aleh). Nafs halka phunka hai jis ke sath thook na ho."
"842","Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi aisa khuwab dekhey jo wo napasand karta hai to apne baayein taraf teen martaba thookey aur teen martaba shaitaan se Allah ki panah maangey aur jis pehlu par tha us se phir jaey. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"843","Abul Asqa Wasilah bin Al-Asqa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak sab se barey jhoot mein se hai ke aadmi apne baap ke siwa kisi aur ki taraf mansoob ho, ya apni aankhon ko wo dikhaey jo unhon-ne nahi dekha, ya Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par wo baat kahey jo Aap ne nahi kahi. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
